# Frozen provenance depends on byte-identical files across platforms.
# Every text artifact is stored and checked out with LF so that the SHA-256
# values recorded in MANIFEST.sha256, in the dataset manifests and in the
# experiment manifests verify on Linux, macOS and Windows alike.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.xlsx binary
*.xlsb binary
*.xlsm binary
*.xls binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
